  "body": "**SALE THIS WEEK ONLY** Call to discuss, grab a great deal!\r\n\r\nThis beautifully renovated relocatable home offers the perfect blend of character, \r\ncomfort, and modern living. With a good floor area 100sqm and a light-filled interior, this home provides plenty of space for families, couples, or those looking for a quality secondary dwelling.\r\n\r\nFeaturing three good-sized bedrooms, two bathrooms, and a separate laundry, the layout is practical and functional while maintaining a warm and welcoming feel. Stunning polished native timber flooring flows throughout, adding timeless charm and character.\r\nUnderfloor air conditioning unit and heat pump.\r\n\r\nLarge windows allow natural light to pour into the home, creating bright and inviting living spaces. The home has been tastefully renovated throughout, meaning much of the hard work has already been done.\r\n\r\n* 3 spacious bedrooms\r\n* 2 bathrooms\r\n* Separate laundry\r\n* Great floor layout\r\n* Polished native timber flooring\r\n* Beautifully renovated throughout\r\n* Solid Weatherboard cladding\r\n* Good Iron roof\r\n* Quality wooden joinery\r\n* Bright, sunny interior with plenty of natural light\r\n\r\nReady for relocation! \r\n\r\nThe base cladding will be completed by the purchaser, providing a fantastic opportunity to add your own finishing touch. Let your imagination run free and create the look you've always wanted to suit your site and personal style.\r\n\r\nThis is a quality home with great bones, plenty of character and ready for a  new set of memories...\r\n\r\nWhether you're looking for a family home, guest accommodation, or an addition to a lifestyle property, this home is well worth viewing.\r\n\r\nGet in touch to arrange a viewing! Reference: #Strat\r\n\r\nPrice includes GST and relocation within 100kms. Foundations included at a standard 3604 pile height and depth. Price is for house and relocation only (not the section).\r\n\r\nFor viewing or more information please contact me. \r\nCall/Text or email: Marissa on 0274 999 828 Email: marissa@nzhouseremovals.co.nz\r\n\r\nPrice does not include any Council fees, Architect drawings, Insurance or connections to services.\r\n\r\nWe can help you arrange your building consent and Insurance. Finance, subject to terms and conditions, can be arranged as well.\r\n\r\nUse our inhouse Architect for your house Plans and applications with Council as well as Geotech, engineers and surveyor’s. Call or Text Marissa on 0274999828\r\n\r\nKEYWORDS: transportable home, transportable dwelling, transportable building, transportable house, relocatable house, relocatable dwelling, relocatable building, removable house, removable dwelling, removable home, removable building, villa, house for removal, building for removal, dwelling for removal, home for removal, house haulage, clear my site, houses for removal, homes for removal, buildings for removal, dwellings for removal, renovate, investment, house demolition, demolition, bungalow, character home, character dwelling, character building, development, investment opportunity, developments, preloved home, preloved house, secondhand house, second hand house, portable home, portable house.",
